# {{label|en|anatomy}} Pertaining to [[lymph]] or the [[lymphatic system]].
# Lacking energy or enthusiasm.
# Madly enthusiastic; frantic.
#* Sir T. Herbert
#*: '''Lymphatic''' rapture.

